  (text "ESC CONTROLLER  -  ESP32 DevKit V1 (30 pin)  -  rev C" (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 3 3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 425ce4aa-349e-49ea-a530-61ca6c289177))
  (text "Wire pads J2..J7 are 1 x 2 mm SMD pads for flying leads." (at 15 190 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 91d73a33-4ba3-44be-a649-09c4530ac826))
  (text "J1 is four plated holes - the SSD1306 OLED solders flush to the board, pins down." (at 15 196 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a2739163-3bd0-4d3b-bdf6-c8fd80700510))
  (text "R1 (4k7) is the only component: a pull-down holding the ESC signal low while the ESP32 boots." (at 15 202 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 8af2bc78-7b06-4e99-bff0-062c1c478982))
  (text "Mode switches rely on the ESP32 internal pull-ups (INPUT_PULLUP in firmware)." (at 15 208 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3fe642a7-b65e-4160-af1b-56ad532522b1))
  (text "J4 is one 3-position switch: common to GND, centre position = NORMAL mode." (at 15 214 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1a1336c4-1e93-42de-8537-bd2fba304c75))
  (text "J7 (5V IN) is optional and must not be fed from a BEC while USB is plugged in." (at 15 220 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d58544f3-5ab4-4f6d-9f7a-01e9edd19aba))
  (text "+3V3 is generated by the DevKit's own regulator (U1 pin 30)." (at 15 226 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c59e9704-60bc-4838-b0d9-4046fd0725db))

